{
  "prereg": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "text": "/**"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "text": " * 放大验收实验的预登记件机械面（org-v2 17 号票；规格 §J「放大验证实验设计」、"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "text": " * 附录 A B 组 `V-B1`／`V-B2` 与「预登记件（实验前冻结，跑完不得改）」节）。"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "text": " *"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "text": " * 本模块只把守**预登记件**这一件事：基准集（3–5 个任务按放大机制各取一、每任务"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "text": " * 四要素简报＋可执行 acceptance）、对照口径（裸实例＝同模型、同基础工具面、"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "text": " * 无组织命令 op、无组织层脚手架、预算同量级）、数值门槛与成本口径的形状，"
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "text": " * 以及**冻结摘要**与裸对照入集判定。判据语义不在本模块（语义权威＝规格附录 A，"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "text": " * 冻结）——故本件不是第二份判据清单，而是「实验前必须由用户预登记并随即冻结」"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "text": " * 这条纪律的机械面。"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "text": " *"
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "text": " * 数值门槛（绝对预算 B、量级倍数、重派封顶、初审与越权阈值——规格 §Testing"
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "text": " * Decisions 与「预登记件」节逐条点名）属**用户域**：本模块只判「填没填、是不是"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "text": " * 正数、两臂预算是否同量级」，**不发明数值**。未填＝判缺口（`gaps`），非正数＝"
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "text": " * 违例（`violations`）；两条路都 `ok: false`（fail closed），冻结与判定都进不去。"
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "text": " *"
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "text": " * 对照口径按**命令面**切（规格 §J 价值表述括注「裸＝去组织层不去基础工具面」）："
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "text": " * 组织命令词表取 `lib/org/op-set.js` 的台账命令面（**单一源**，本模块不另抄"
    },
    {
      "number": 19,
      "text": " * 一份），裸侧一条都不许持；基础工具面（文件与执行工具）两臂须相同。"
    },
    {
      "number": 20,
      "text": " *"
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "text": " * 冻结＝对规范化 JSON 取 sha256：预登记件任何一字节改动都会换摘要，故「跑完"
    },
    {
      "number": 22,
      "text": " * 未改」可由摘要复验（`preregistrationUnchanged`）。入集判定（`admitBareSet`）"
    },
    {
      "number": 23,
      "text": " * 按 `V-B1`「裸对照先跑，失败方入集、裸跑成功即出集，不留在集里充数」——出集"
    },
    {
      "number": 24,
      "text": " * 带走的机制如实登记进 `mechanismsLost`（诊断事实），入集为空即无结论可出。"
    },
    {
      "number": 25,
      "text": " */"
    },
    {
      "number": 26,
      "text": "import { canonicalJson, sha256Hex } from \"./store-base.js\";"
    },
    {
      "number": 27,
      "text": "import { isPlainObject } from \"./capability-base.js\";"
    },
    {
      "number": 28,
      "text": "import { isTaskId } from \"./ledger-events.js\";"
    },
    {
      "number": 29,
      "text": "import { validateBrief } from \"./brief.js\";"
    },
    {
      "number": 30,
      "text": "import { LEDGER_COMMAND_OPS } from \"./op-set.js\";"
    },
    {
      "number": 31,
      "text": "import { isNonEmptyString } from \"./is-non-empty-string.js\";"
    },
    {
      "number": 32,
      "text": "import { COST_TOKEN_COMPONENTS, closedKeys, isPositiveNumber, sameStringSet, stringListViolations } from \"./experiment-shape.js\";"
    },
    {
      "number": 33,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 34,
      "text": "/** 预登记件 schema 版本（形状变更须走规格修订，不静默兼容旧形状）。 */"
    },
    {
      "number": 35,
      "text": "export const PREREG_SCHEMA_VERSION = \"org-v2/amplification-prereg@1\";"
    },
    {
      "number": 36,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 37,
      "text": "/** 放大机制封闭枚举（规格 §J：多跳研究、跨文件代码改动、长周期值守例程）。 */"
    },
    {
      "number": 38,
      "text": "export const EXPERIMENT_MECHANISMS = Object.freeze(["
    },
    {
      "number": 39,
      "text": "  Object.freeze({ id: \"multi-hop-research\", label: \"多跳研究\" }),"
    },
    {
      "number": 40,
      "text": "  Object.freeze({ id: \"cross-file-change\", label: \"跨文件代码改动\" }),"
    },
    {
      "number": 41,
      "text": "  Object.freeze({ id: \"long-running-duty\", label: \"长周期值守例程\" })"
    },
    {
      "number": 42,
      "text": "]);"
    },
    {
      "number": 43,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 44,
      "text": "/** 机制 id 列表（覆盖判定的封闭词表）。 */"
    },
    {
      "number": 45,
      "text": "export const MECHANISM_IDS = Object.freeze(EXPERIMENT_MECHANISMS.map((entry) => entry.id));"
    },
    {
      "number": 46,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 47,
      "text": "/**"
    },
    {
      "number": 48,
      "text": " * 组织命令 op 词表＝台账命令面**单一源**（`lib/org/op-set.js`）。裸侧持有其中"
    },
    {
      "number": 49,
      "text": " * 任何一条即违「无组织命令 op」；组织侧声明的 op 须落在同一词表内（口径闭包）。"
    },
    {
      "number": 50,
      "text": " */"
    },
    {
      "number": 51,
      "text": "export const ORG_COMMAND_OPS = Object.freeze([...LEDGER_COMMAND_OPS]);"
    },
    {
      "number": 52,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 53,
      "text": "/** 预登记件顶层键（封闭枚举）。 */"
    },
    {
      "number": 54,
      "text": "export const PREREG_KEYS = Object.freeze([\"schemaVersion\", \"experimentId\", \"tasks\", \"profiles\", \"thresholds\", \"costMetrics\"]);"
    },
    {
      "number": 55,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 56,
      "text": "/** 基准集任务条目键（封闭枚举）。 */"
    },
